    skos:prefLabel "6 Act to bind the Crown"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Act binds the Crown in each of its capacities. (2) Nothing in this Act renders the Crown liable to be prosecuted for an offence." ;
