    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-8-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If a maximum penalty is specified: (a) at the foot of a section of this Act (other than a section that is divided into subsections); or (b) at the foot of a subsection of this Act; then:   Preliminary  Part 1  Section 8 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024 (c) a person who contravenes the section or subsection commits an offence punishable, on conviction, by a penalty not exceeding the specified penalty; or (d) the offence referred to in the section or subsection is punishable, on conviction, by a penalty not exceeding the specified penalty." ;
