concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-35a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35A Person must not breach conditions of emergency dealing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-35a ;
    values:originalText "determination (1) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person intentionally takes an action or omits to take an action; and (b) the person has knowledge of the conditions to which an emergency dealing determination is subject; and (c) the action or omission contravenes such a condition, and the person knows or is reckless as to that fact. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility. (2) An offence under this section is punishable on conviction by whichever of the following applies:   Regulation of dealings with GMOs  Part 4 Dealings with GMOs must be licensed  Division 2 Section 35B Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024 (a) in the case of an aggravated offence—imprisonment for 5 years or 2,000 penalty units; (b) in any other case—imprisonment for 2 years or 500 penalty units. Note: Section 38 defines aggravated offence." ;
    skos:definition "determination (1) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person intentionally takes an action or omits to take an action; and (b) the person has knowledge of the conditions to which an emergency dealing determination is subject; and (c) the action or omission contravenes such a condition, and the person knows or is reckless as to that fact. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility. (2) An offence under this section is punishable on conviction by whichever of the following applies:   Regulation of dealings with GMOs  Part 4 Dealings with GMOs must be licensed  Division 2 Section 35B Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024 (a) in the case of an aggravated offence—imprisonment for 5 years or 2,000 penalty units; (b) in any other case—imprisonment for 2 years or 500 penalty units. Note: Section 38 defines aggravated offence."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "95f1a23373195c7816d78c02422e5944df04440e32be8972aa51a82f68c57237" ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-35a-ss-1 ;
