    skos:definition "(2) An offence under this section is punishable on conviction by whichever of the following applies:   Regulation of dealings with GMOs  Part 4 Dealings with GMOs must be licensed  Division 2 Section 35B Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024 (a) in the case of an aggravated offence—imprisonment for 5 years or 2,000 penalty units; (b) in any other case—imprisonment for 2 years or 500 penalty units. Note: Section 38 defines aggravated offence."@en ;
