    skos:prefLabel "40(3) Person may apply for a licence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The application must specify whether any of the dealings proposed to be authorised by the licence would involve the intentional release of a GMO into the environment." ;
