    values:originalText "(2) In preparing the risk management plan, the Regulator must take into account the following: (a) the means of managing any risks posed by those dealings in such a way as to protect: (i) the health and safety of people; and (ii) the environment; (c) any advice in relation to the risk management plan provided by a State or a local council in response to a request under subsection 50(3); (d) any advice in relation to the risk management plan provided by the Gene Technology Technical Advisory Committee in response to a request under subsection 50(3);" ;
