concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-58-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "58(4) Matters to be taken into account in deciding whether a person is"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-58-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Nothing in this section affects the operation of Part VIIC of the Crimes Act 1914 (which includes provisions that, in certain circumstances, relieve persons from the requirement to disclose spent convictions and require persons aware of such convictions to disregard them)." ;
