concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-63 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "63 Condition about informing people of obligations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-63 ;
    values:originalText "(1) It is a condition of a licence that the licence holder inform any person covered by the licence, to whom a particular condition of the licence applies, of the following: (a) the particular condition, including any variations of it; (b) the cancellation or suspension of the licence; (c) the surrender of the licence. (2) Requirements in relation to the manner in which information is provided under subsection (1) may be: (a) prescribed by the regulations; or (b) specified by the Regulator. (3) Such requirements may include, but are not limited to, measures relating to labelling, packaging, conducting training and providing information. (4) If such requirements are prescribed or specified, it is a condition of a licence that the licence holder comply with the requirements.   Licensing system  Part 5 Conditions of licences  Division 6 Section 64 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024" ;
    skos:definition "(1) It is a condition of a licence that the licence holder inform any person covered by the licence, to whom a particular condition of the licence applies, of the following: (a) the particular condition, including any variations of it; (b) the cancellation or suspension of the licence; (c) the surrender of the licence. (2) Requirements in relation to the manner in which information is provided under subsection (1) may be: (a) prescribed by the regulations; or (b) specified by the Regulator. (3) Such requirements may include, but are not limited to, measures relating to labelling, packaging, conducting training and providing information. (4) If such requirements are prescribed or specified, it is a condition of a licence that the licence holder comply with the requirements.   Licensing system  Part 5 Conditions of licences  Division 6 Section 64 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b4af18ca65fe2fb69edb2c89d5e462ded39d909411ad302eaa2b1417a9d77173" ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-63-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-63-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-63-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-63-ss-4 ;
