    cof:title "78(2) Regulator may include dealings with GMOs on GMO Register" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A determination under subsection (1) may be made: (a) on application by the holder of a licence that authorises the dealing; or (b) on the initiative of the Regulator." ;
