concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-80 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80 Variation of GMO Register"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-80 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Regulator may, by legislative instrument, vary the GMO Register. (2) A variation may: (a) remove a dealing from the GMO Register; or (b) revoke or vary conditions to which a dealing on the GMO Register is subject; or (c) impose additional conditions to which a dealing on the GMO Register is subject.   Regulation of notifiable low risk dealings and dealings on the GMO Register  Part 6 The GMO Register  Division 3 Section 81 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Regulator may, by legislative instrument, vary the GMO Register. (2) A variation may: (a) remove a dealing from the GMO Register; or (b) revoke or vary conditions to which a dealing on the GMO Register is subject; or (c) impose additional conditions to which a dealing on the GMO Register is subject.   Regulation of notifiable low risk dealings and dealings on the GMO Register  Part 6 The GMO Register  Division 3 Section 81 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "196372e22a256aad848f95d0ce90f7e7dd805e119f4d053a5d43eb12786e008d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-80-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-80-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <gene-technology-act-2000.pdf> ;
    dc:source "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.82" .
