    cml:premiseText "(2) A variation may revoke or vary conditions to which a dealing on the GMO Register is subject;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "The revocation or variation of conditions occurs until the end of the variation." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::temporal_ltl" ;
    cml:confidence "0.5000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-80-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "80(2) Variation of GMO Register" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A variation may: (a) remove a dealing from the GMO Register; or (b) revoke or vary conditions to which a dealing on the GMO Register is subject; or (c) impose additional conditions to which a dealing on the GMO Register is subject.   Regulation of notifiable low risk dealings and dealings on the GMO Register  Part 6 The GMO Register  Division 3 Section 81 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024" ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer .

