concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-93 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "93 Regulator may require applicant to give further information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-93 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Regulator may, by notice in writing, require an applicant for accreditation of an organisation to give the Regulator such further information in relation to the application as the Regulator requires. (2) The notice may specify the period within which the information is to be provided." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Regulator may, by notice in writing, require an applicant for accreditation of an organisation to give the Regulator such further information in relation to the application as the Regulator requires. (2) The notice may specify the period within which the information is to be provided."@en ;
