ure that the Committee includes at least one person who is a member of the Ethics and Community Committee. The Minister is not required to be satisfied that this person has skills or experience in an area mentioned in subsection (5). (8) The Minister must not appoint a member to chair the Committee unless a majority of jurisdictions agree to the appointment." ;
