concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-100-ss-7a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "100(7A) The Gene Technology Technical Advisory Committee"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-100-ss-7a ;
    values:originalText "(7A) The Minister must ensure that the Committee includes at least one person who is a member of the Ethics and Community Committee. The Minister is not required to be satisfied that this person has skills or experience in an area mentioned in subsection (5)." ;
