doc:sec-110-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "110(1) Membership and Procedures" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may prescribe matters relating to the members of the Ethics and Community Committee, including, but not limited to, the following: (a) term of appointment; (b) resignation;   The Gene Technology Technical Advisory Committee and the Gene Technology Ethics and Community Consultative Committee  Part 8 The Gene Technology Ethics and Community Consultative Committee  Division 3 Section 111 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024 (c) disclosure of interests; (d) termination of appointment; (e) leave of absence." ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer .

concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-110-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "110(2) Membership and Procedures"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-110-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The regulations may prescribe matters relating to the operation of the Ethics and Community Committee, including, but not limited to, the following: (a) procedures for convening meetings of the Ethics and Community Committee; (b) the constitution of a quorum for a meeting of the Ethics and Community Committee; (c) the way in which matters are to be resolved by the Ethics and Community Committee; (d) Ethics and Community Committee records; (e) reporting requirements, including, but not limited to, reports to the Regulator and to the public." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The regulations may prescribe matters relating to the operation of the Ethics and Community Committee, including, but not limited to, the following: (a) procedures for convening meetings of the Ethics and Community Committee; (b) the constitution of a quorum for a meeting of the Ethics and Community Committee; (c) the way in which matters are to be resolved by the Ethics and Community Committee; (d) Ethics and Community Committee records; (e) reporting requirements, including, but not limited to, reports to the Regulator and to the public."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "de5bfc8357e9b0c974ff2f5b84a0d55233af282176655fc140e5ac46521bb0ba" ;
    values:partOf concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-110 ;
