    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-111 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Ethics and Community Committee may, with the Regulator’s consent, establish subcommittees to assist in the performance of its functions. (2) The regulations may prescribe matters relating to the constitution and operation of subcommittees." ;
