concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-137 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "137 Reports to Parliament"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-137 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Regulator may at any time cause a report about matters relating to the Regulator’s functions to be tabled in either House of the Parliament. (2) The Regulator must give a copy of the report to the Minister and to each State.   Administration  Part 9 Record of GMO Dealings  Division 6 Section 138 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024" ;
