concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-141 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "141 Regulator may review exemptions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-141 ;
    values:originalText "The Regulator may, at any time, in accordance with this Division, consider the following matters: (a) whether a dealing that is an exempt dealing within the meaning of subsection 32(3) should not be an exempt dealing; (b) whether a dealing should be an exempt dealing within the meaning of that subsection." ;
    skos:definition "The Regulator may, at any time, in accordance with this Division, consider the following matters: (a) whether a dealing that is an exempt dealing within the meaning of subsection 32(3) should not be an exempt dealing; (b) whether a dealing should be an exempt dealing within the meaning of that subsection."@en ;
