doc:sec-143-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "143(3) What Regulator may do after consideration" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the matter relates to whether a dealing: (a) should be an exempt dealing; or   Administration  Part 9 Reviews of notifiable low risk dealings and exemptions  Division 7 Section 144 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024 (b) should cease to be an exempt dealing; the Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the regulations be amended accordingly." ;
    cof:pageNumber "116"^^xsd:integer .

