doc:sec-151-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151(4) Identity card" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) An inspector must carry his or her identity card at all times when exercising powers or performing functions as an inspector.   Powers of inspection  Part 11 Monitoring powers  Division 3 Section 152 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024" ;
    cof:pageNumber "124"^^xsd:integer .

concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-152 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152 Powers available to inspectors for monitoring compliance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-152 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purpose of finding out whether this Act or the regulations have been complied with, an inspector may: (a) enter any premises; and (b) exercise the monitoring powers set out in section 153. (2) An inspector is not authorised to enter premises under subsection (1) unless: (a) the occupier of the premises has consented to the entry; or (b) the entry is made under a warrant under section 172; or (c) the occupier of the premises is a licence holder, or a person covered by a licence, and the entry is at a reasonable time; or (d) the occupier of the premises is a person dealing with, or who has dealt with, a GMO specified in an emergency dealing determination, and the entry is at a reasonable time." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purpose of finding out whether this Act or the regulations have been complied with, an inspector may: (a) enter any premises; and (b) exercise the monitoring powers set out in section 153. (2) An inspector is not authorised to enter premises under subsection (1) unless: (a) the occupier of the premises has consented to the entry; or (b) the entry is made under a warrant under section 172; or (c) the occupier of the premises is a licence holder, or a person covered by a licence, and the entry is at a reasonable time; or (d) the occupier of the premises is a person dealing with, or who has dealt with, a GMO specified in an emergency dealing determination, and the entry is at a reasonable time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b0d8aa78408f216417a82ac107dbba38b0164fc2c4bde0ce8567eb3e1ed20ff1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "125"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-152-ss-1 ;
