concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-158-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "158(4) Powers available to inspectors for dealing with dangerous"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-158-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the Regulator incurs costs because of steps reasonably taken or arranged to be taken by an inspector under paragraph (2)(e), the person is liable to pay to the Commonwealth an amount equal to the costs, and the amount may be recovered by the Commonwealth as a debt due to the Commonwealth in a court of competent jurisdiction.   Powers of inspection  Part 11 Obligations and incidental powers of inspectors  Division 7 Section 159 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the Regulator incurs costs because of steps reasonably taken or arranged to be taken by an inspector under paragraph (2)(e), the person is liable to pay to the Commonwealth an amount equal to the costs, and the amount may be recovered by the Commonwealth as a debt due to the Commonwealth in a court of competent jurisdiction.   Powers of inspection  Part 11 Obligations and incidental powers of inspectors  Division 7 Section 159 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a2e1808b14c2beccb5e73402ff4b50bc0e721b88e00496ba60e30d0de28a8bcd" ;
    values:partOf concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-158 ;
    cof:pageNumber "132"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Person liable for costs incurred by Commonwealth due to inspector's actions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
