doc:sec-163-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "163(3) Compensation for damage" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) In determining the amount of compensation payable, regard is to be had to whether the occupier of the premises and his or her employees and agents, if they were available at the time, had provided any warning or guidance as to the operation of the thing that was appropriate in the circumstances.   Powers of inspection  Part 11 Power to search goods, baggage etc.  Division 8 Section 164 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024" ;
    cof:pageNumber "134"^^xsd:integer .

