concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-166 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "166 Copies of seized things to be provided"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-166 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subsection (2), if an inspector seizes, under a warrant relating to premises: (a) a document, film, computer file or other thing that can be readily copied; or (b) a storage device, the information in which can be readily copied; the inspector must, if requested to do so by the occupier of the premises, or another person who apparently represents the occupier and who is present when the warrant is executed, give a copy of the thing or the information to that person as soon as practicable after the seizure. (2) Subsection (1) does not apply if: (a) the thing that has been seized was seized under paragraph 156(2)(b) or (c); or (b) possession by the occupier of the document, film, computer file, thing or information could constitute an offence." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subsection (2), if an inspector seizes, under a warrant relating to premises: (a) a document, film, computer file or other thing that can be readily copied; or (b) a storage device, the information in which can be readily copied; the inspector must, if requested to do so by the occupier of the premises, or another person who apparently represents the occupier and who is present when the warrant is executed, give a copy of the thing or the information to that person as soon as practicable after the seizure. (2) Subsection (1) does not apply if: (a) the thing that has been seized was seized under paragraph 156(2)(b) or (c); or (b) possession by the occupier of the document, film, computer file, thing or information could constitute an offence."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "72c332689e56c4fd802dbb7250e6472cb44a5de1b546c25014eb1b9a71712db2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-166-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-166-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <gene-technology-act-2000.pdf> ;
    dc:source "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.136" .
