concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-170-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "170(3) Magistrate may permit a thing to be retained"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-170-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Before making the application, the inspector must: (a) take reasonable steps to discover who has an interest in the retention of the thing; and (b) if it is practicable to do so, notify each person whom the inspector believes to have such an interest of the proposed application." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Before making the application, the inspector must: (a) take reasonable steps to discover who has an interest in the retention of the thing; and (b) if it is practicable to do so, notify each person whom the inspector believes to have such an interest of the proposed application."@en ;
