concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-178 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "178 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-178 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: This Part provides for miscellaneous matters, including the following: (a) review of decisions; (b) provisions relating to confidential commercial information; (c) the making of regulations; (d) transitional provisions; (e) review of the operation of the Act.   Miscellaneous  Part 12 Review of decisions  Division 2 Section 179 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024" ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: This Part provides for miscellaneous matters, including the following: (a) review of decisions; (b) provisions relating to confidential commercial information; (c) the making of regulations; (d) transitional provisions; (e) review of the operation of the Act.   Miscellaneous  Part 12 Review of decisions  Division 2 Section 179 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0191dace1f995d64f1df561ca81bfb83aae1b9a4b99e51f47bb4b687b18e3502" ;
    cof:pageNumber "146"^^xsd:integer ;
