concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-183a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "183A Extended standing for judicial review"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-183a ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section extends (and does not limit) the meaning of the term person aggrieved in the Administrative Decisions (Judicial Review) Act 1977 for the purposes of the application of that Act in relation to: (a) a decision made under this Act or the regulations; or (b) a failure to make a decision under this Act or the regulations; or (c) conduct engaged in for the purpose of making a decision under this Act or the regulations. (2) A State is taken to be a person aggrieved by the decision, failure or conduct. (3) A term (except person aggrieved) used in this section and in the Administrative Decisions (Judicial Review) Act 1977 has the same meaning in this section as it has in that Act.   Miscellaneous  Part 12 Confidential commercial information  Division 3 Section 184 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section extends (and does not limit) the meaning of the term person aggrieved in the Administrative Decisions (Judicial Review) Act 1977 for the purposes of the application of that Act in relation to: (a) a decision made under this Act or the regulations; or (b) a failure to make a decision under this Act or the regulations; or (c) conduct engaged in for the purpose of making a decision under this Act or the regulations. (2) A State is taken to be a person aggrieved by the decision, failure or conduct. (3) A term (except person aggrieved) used in this section and in the Administrative Decisions (Judicial Review) Act 1977 has the same meaning in this section as it has in that Act.   Miscellaneous  Part 12 Confidential commercial information  Division 3 Section 184 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "30b63cbe8f10d04e8c064e2e2d3e9bc68db52a882366ae80a177bc3d13ad14fd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "150"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-183a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-183a-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-183a-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <gene-technology-act-2000.pdf> ;
    dc:source "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.150" .
