concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-187 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "187 Confidential commercial information must not be disclosed"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-187 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person who: (a) has confidential commercial information; and (b) has it only because of performing duties or functions under this Act or under a corresponding State law; and (c) knows that the information is confidential commercial information; must not disclose the information except: (d) to any of the following in the course of carrying out duties or functions under this Act or under a corresponding State law: (i) the Commonwealth or a Commonwealth authority; (ii) a State agency;" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person who: (a) has confidential commercial information; and (b) has it only because of performing duties or functions under this Act or under a corresponding State law; and (c) knows that the information is confidential commercial information; must not disclose the information except: (d) to any of the following in the course of carrying out duties or functions under this Act or under a corresponding State law: (i) the Commonwealth or a Commonwealth authority; (ii) a State agency;"@en ;
