concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-188-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "188(4) Conduct by directors, employees and agents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-188-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Any conduct engaged in on behalf of a person (the first person), other than a body corporate, by an employee or agent of the first person, within the scope of the actual or apparent authority of the employee or agent is taken, for the purposes of a prosecution for: (a) an offence against this Act or the regulations; or   Miscellaneous  Part 12 Conduct by directors, employees and agents  Division 4 Section 189 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024 (b) an ancillary offence relating to this Act or the regulations; to have been engaged in also by the first person unless the first person establishes that he or she took reasonable precautions and exercised due diligence to avoid the conduct." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Any conduct engaged in on behalf of a person (the first person), other than a body corporate, by an employee or agent of the first person, within the scope of the actual or apparent authority of the employee or agent is taken, for the purposes of a prosecution for: (a) an offence against this Act or the regulations; or   Miscellaneous  Part 12 Conduct by directors, employees and agents  Division 4 Section 189 Gene Technology Act 2000 Compilation date: 14/10/2024 (b) an ancillary offence relating to this Act or the regulations; to have been engaged in also by the first person unless the first person establishes that he or she took reasonable precautions and exercised due diligence to avoid the conduct."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d174a933dcf9e0f8aacc80b4213da1fe7bcda1df24511cc0cb31ea875516d4ef" ;
    values:partOf concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-188 ;
