concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-189-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "189(4) Meaning of terms"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-189-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A reference in section 188 to an ancillary offence relating to this Act or the regulations is a reference to an offence: (a) against section 6 of the Crimes Act 1914; or (b) that is taken to have been committed because of section 11.2 or 11.2A of the Criminal Code; or (c) against section 11.1, 11.4 or 11.5 of the Criminal Code; that relates to this Act or the regulations." ;
