concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-192 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "192 False or misleading information or document"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-192 ;
    values:originalText "A person must not: (a) in connection with an application made to the Regulator under this Act or the regulations; or (b) in compliance or purported compliance with this Act or the regulations; do either of the following: (c) give information (whether orally or in writing) that the person knows to be false or misleading in a material particular; (d) produce a document that the person knows to be false or misleading in a material particular without: (i) indicating to the person to whom the document is produced that it is false or misleading, and the respect in which it is false or misleading; and (ii) providing correct information to that person, if the person producing the document is in possession of, or can reasonably acquire, the correct information. Maximum penalty: Imprisonment for 1 year or 60 penalty units. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility." ;
    skos:definition "A person must not: (a) in connection with an application made to the Regulator under this Act or the regulations; or (b) in compliance or purported compliance with this Act or the regulations; do either of the following: (c) give information (whether orally or in writing) that the person knows to be false or misleading in a material particular; (d) produce a document that the person knows to be false or misleading in a material particular without: (i) indicating to the person to whom the document is produced that it is false or misleading, and the respect in which it is false or misleading; and (ii) providing correct information to that person, if the person producing the document is in possession of, or can reasonably acquire, the correct information. Maximum penalty: Imprisonment for 1 year or 60 penalty units. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bda0a2c857879f5c3d8cbc78045f178c6dbcce1c8c5f52e190fd69ca3af130ee" ;
    cof:pageNumber "160"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibition on providing false or misleading information" ;
    dc:description "Correct information when requested" ;
